## 3. Connection Lifecycle & Preventing Resource Leaks

### Strict `try ... finally` Resource Disposal Pattern
A common failure in long-running tools is exhausting the target database's connection pool.

```javascript
export async function withPgClient(connectionString, callback) {
  const client = new Client({ connectionString, ssl: getSslConfig(connectionString) });
  await client.connect();
  try {
    return await callback(client);
  } finally {
    await client.end().catch(() => {}); // Guaranteed cleanup
  }
}
```

